      "id": 489890,
      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-12-31T01:25:49.576Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m not understanding your desired result.</p>\n<p>You say the RFQ number is generated manually. To me this means we can’t automate it with ERPNext.</p>\n<p>If the number needs to be manually entered, why not simply enter the five other characters as well?</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">EDIT: choose \"Set by User\" for the Naming Rule when customizing RFQ doctype\n</code></pre>\n<p>If you want the user to add the sequence of digits, create a custom field for this like <code>custom_name_postfix</code>. Make this field mandatory, but you won’t be able to set it as unique as number may repeat after some years, yes?</p>\n<p>Then customize <code>Request For Quotation</code>, create the custom field, and set is as part of the naming.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/0/30621b4c12a6fb1fb5fff431978293a2456c3f24.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/30621b4c12a6fb1fb5fff431978293a2456c3f24\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.25.32 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/0/30621b4c12a6fb1fb5fff431978293a2456c3f24_2_690x448.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.25.32 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"6U16SW7q5vBvVY8TColaJ29ycHa\" width=\"690\" height=\"448\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/0/30621b4c12a6fb1fb5fff431978293a2456c3f24_2_690x448.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/0/30621b4c12a6fb1fb5fff431978293a2456c3f24.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/0/30621b4c12a6fb1fb5fff431978293a2456c3f24.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1C1C1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.25.32 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">837×544 32.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>If you can convince management to let ERPNext generate the number, than you can use the naming series settings to create it.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/b/3beead0a6a26c1e7592e2153e40e425aa99c5f50.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/3beead0a6a26c1e7592e2153e40e425aa99c5f50\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.18.04 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3beead0a6a26c1e7592e2153e40e425aa99c5f50_2_690x210.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.18.04 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"8ybwXt98nApkDxcUDyDGwfnF6ow\" width=\"690\" height=\"210\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3beead0a6a26c1e7592e2153e40e425aa99c5f50_2_690x210.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3beead0a6a26c1e7592e2153e40e425aa99c5f50_2_1035x315.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/b/3beead0a6a26c1e7592e2153e40e425aa99c5f50_2_1380x420.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1E1E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.18.04 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1475×449 38.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>If you want to set the next number to keep it sequential with what’s been used so far, set the sequence after saving the new naming format so you can choose it for the prefix.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/9/89297a36e143a829e8101609442f58ef7039ec1a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/89297a36e143a829e8101609442f58ef7039ec1a\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.18.56 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/9/89297a36e143a829e8101609442f58ef7039ec1a.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.18.56 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"jzohg3AXCEuOAUd5DZ1hSKAUFE6\" width=\"690\" height=\"345\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1E1E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-30 at 8.18.56 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">764×382 12.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Are you wishing to have ERPNext partially populate the name field, so the user can manually add the remaining digits?</p>",
